==Example tree runs==
Start out at the [[Grand Exchange]] and buy all of the saplings, payments and teleports needed.

In the first run, the player will have to rake all of the patches. In subsequent runs, this is only necessary if a [[Farming#Growth cycles|growth cycle]] happens in between removing the tree and planting a new one. It is recommended to leave a rake at a [[Tool Leprechaun]] in case this happens.

===Example low-level tree run===
{{Inventory
|align = right|Coins 10000\2000000|Spade|Willow sapling|Willow sapling|Willow sapling|Willow sapling|Willow sapling|Willow sapling|Ring of wealth|Taverley teleport|Lumbridge teleport (tablet)|Varrock teleport (tablet)|Banana sapling|Banana sapling|Banana sapling|Banana sapling|Banana sapling|Stamina potion|Catherby teleport (tablet)|Digsite pendant|Pendant of ates|Rune pouch|Apples(5)\100;n|Limpwurt root\100;n|Teak sapling|Teak sapling|Teak sapling|Teak sapling|
}}
This is an example setup for doing a tree run consisting of 6 trees, 5 fruit trees and 5 hardwood trees at level 35. This run does not include the [[Lletya]] fruit tree due to the quests required however the last step is shown as an example, nor the tree and fruit tree patches in the Farming Guild due to the Farming level requirements.

The route assumes the player pays the farmers to chop down the trees and to look after them.

====Items needed====
*Coins
*Spade
*Stamina potion
*6 tree, 5 fruit tree, and 5 hardwood tree saplings.
**7 tree saplings if the farming guild patch is unlocked ({{SCP|Farming}}65 Farming).
**6 fruit tree saplings if Lletya patch is unlocked (started {{SCP|Quest}} [[Mourning's End Part I]]).
**7 fruit tree saplings if both the Lletya and the farming guild ({{SCP|Farming}}85 Farming) patches are unlocked.
*Payments in banknotes
*[[Ring of wealth]] with at least 2 charges
**Alternatively, Falador teleport then run to Falador Park
*Teleports to Lumbridge, Varrock, and Catherby
*Slayer ring
**Alternatively, use the spirit tree to Tree Gnome Stronghold and run south-west
**Alternatively, use the [[Royal seed pod|Royal Seed Pod]] to teleport to the Tree Gnome Stronghold and run south-west. (Requires completion of [[Monkey Madness II]])
*Teleport to house tablets and redirection scrolls for access to Taverley and Brimhaven house portals
**Alternatively, a teleport to Falador for the Taverley patch
**Alternatively, take the charter ship from Catherby to Brimhaven.
**Alternatively, a teleport near a charter ship for the Brimhaven patch.
*[[Digsite pendant]] or a Digsite teleport for hardwood trees
*[[Pendant of ates]] (Optional for faster transportation to the Kastori and Nemus Retreat patches)
*[[Rune pouch]] (Optional. Frees up inventory space that was used by Teleport Tabs to Falador, Lumbridge, Varrock, and Ardougne)
**Recommended rune setup: Dust-Steam-Law,  Lava-Mist-Law, or Air-Water-Law with a [[Lava battlestaff]] equipped.
*Rake stored at a Tool Leprechaun
*An Axe (Optional, if not paying for the farmers to remove the tree)

====Doing the run====
For each step, check the health of the tree and replant it.

#Teleport to Falador Park with the ring of wealth to the tree patch. Alternatively, use Falador Teleport and run east.
#Teleport to Taverley and run east to the tree patch. Alternatively, run north from Falador.
#Teleport to Lumbridge, run west through Lumbridge Castle and exit through the castle walls to find a tree patch. 
#Teleport to Varrock, run a bit north and then north-east to the tree patch.
#Use your [[Slayer ring|Slayer ring]] to teleport to the Stronghold Cave tree patch. Alternatively, use a spirit tree or [[Royal seed pod|Royal Seed Pod]] to teleport to Tree Gnome Stronghold and run south-west to the tree patch.
#Run north-east and turn east at the spirit tree to reach the fruit tree patch
#Use the spirit tree to teleport to Tree Gnome Village. Run to the south-west corner of the fence and squeeze through the entrance. Click on [[Elkoy]] to follow him through the maze, and run a bit south-west to the fruit tree patch.
#Use a skills necklace to teleport to the farming guild for a tree patch ({{SCP|Farming}}65 Farming) and a fruit tree patch ({{SCP|Farming}}85 Farming).
#Teleport to [[Nemus Retreat]] in Varlamore via the [[Pendant of ates]] and run north to the tree patch. Alternatively, travel to [[Quetzacalli Gorge]] via [[Quetzal Transport System|Quetzal transport]] and run north-west to the [[Mountain Guide (Auburn Valley)|Mountain Guide]]. Follow them to Nemus Retreat.
#Use the [[Pendant of ates]] to teleport to Kastori and run south-west to the fruit tree patch. Alternatively, use travel to Kastori via Quetzal Transport and run north-east to the calquat patch ({{SCP|Farming}}72 Farming) and then north-west to fruit tree patch.
#Travel to [[Colossal Wyrm Remains|Colossal Wyrm]] Remains via Quetzal transport and run north to the Hardwood patch at [[Locus Oasis]] . Alternatively, fairy ring to  {{Fairycode|AJP}}  and travel south-east.
#Travel to [[The Summer Shore]] for a calquat patch (requires completion of {{SCP|Quest}} [[Troubled Tortugans]]).
#*Take the fairy ring north-west of Locus Oasis to {{Fairycode|CJQ}}.  Run south ({{SCP|Agility}}50 Agility) and then west to find the calquat patch.
#*Alternatively, use a [[sailors' amulet]] to teleport to [[Deepfin Point]] ({{SCP|Sailing}}67 Sailing), and take the charter ship to [[The Summer Shore]]. <ref group="Q">Any charter ship can be used, but teleporting to [[Deepfin Point]] is the fastest. [[Catherby teleport (tablet)|Catherby teleport]] and [[Khazard Teleport|Khazard teleport]] are some alternatives.</ref> Run north then west to find the calquat patch.
#Teleport to Catherby and run east to the fruit tree patch near the fishing spots. Since a bank is nearby, now would be a good time to deposit hardwood saplings and ultracompost.
#Head to the Brimhaven fruit tree patch by using a house teleport to Brimhaven and running north. Alternatively, take the charter ship from the Catherby Docks to Brimhaven.
#Take the charter ship from Brimhaven to [[Corsair Cove]] and run west to take the [[Rowboat (amenity)|rowboat]] ({{SCP|Sailing}}51 Sailing) to  [[Anglers' Retreat|Angler's Retreat]]. Alternatively, take the Brimhaven spirit tree ({{SCP|Farming}}83 Farming) to [[Feldip Hills|Feldip hills]] and run east to use the rowboat ({{SCP|Sailing}}51 Sailing). The hardwood patch is south of where you arrive.
#Use a Tai Bwo Wannai teleport scroll and run north to the calquat patch ({{SCP|Farming}}72 Farming). Alternatively, fairy ring to  {{Fairycode|CKR}}  and travel north.
#Teleport to the Digsite by using a [[Digsite pendant]] or Digsite teleport. Run to the barge, quick-travel to Fossil Island, and run to the three hardwood tree patches to the north-west.
#Teleport to Lletya with a [[teleport crystal]] and run south-east to the fruit tree patch.
